00:58:32.310 --> 00:58:44.530
<v Elder 1>I thought about it. I was like, I bet selling life insurance is way easier than this. Or like those guys who sell scissors, go door to door, like Cutco, they sell scissors. I'm like, I'm sure I can sell some scissors.
<v Elder 1>我想过。我想，我打赌卖人寿保险比这容易多了。或者像那些挨家挨户卖剪刀的人，像Cutco，他们卖剪刀。我想，我肯定能卖掉一些剪刀。

00:58:44.530 --> 00:58:54.890
